<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In SpecMamba: Accelerating Mamba Inference on FPGA with Speculative Decoding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">VIII </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">conclusion</span></span></a></li>
